#: ../../../prop_dir/RULES.rst:6
msgid ""
"This read-only directory property contains a :ref:`semicolon-separated list "
"<CMake Language Lists>` of rules added in the directory by calls to the :"
"command:`add_custom_rule` command. Each entry in the list is the logical "
"name of a rule, suitable to pass to the :command:`get_property` command "
"``RULE`` option when called in the same directory."
